{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06404","headline":"魏仓曹东堂柽树 · 李颀","name":"魏仓曹东堂柽树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱君双柽一树奇，千叶齐生万叶垂。\n长头拂石带烟雨，独立空山人莫知。\n攒青蓄翠阴满屋，紫穗红英曾断目。\n洛阳墨客游云间，若到麻源第三谷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}